#: src/aarch64.md:6
msgid ""
"The build system support cross-compilation for multiple CPU architectures in "
"the same directory. Building for `aarch64` only requires that you set the "
"`ARCH` environment variable to the correct value. Normally, you would do "
"this in [.config](./configuration-settings.md#config), but you can also do "
"this temporarily with the `make ARCH=aarch64` command, in the shell "
"environment (`export ARCH=aarch64`) or with the [build.sh](./configuration-"
"settings.md#buildsh) script."
msgstr ""

